      "id": "claim_0d6baaae09d34d06aaff3c577491b8d0",
      "statement": "Shared workspace packages provide contract and UI surfaces across runtimes: `@shopwise/env` exports separate web and mobile environment entrypoints, `@shopwise/ui` exports shared styles, components, hooks, and contexts, `@shopwise/api-types` exports API contract modules, `@shopwise/protocols` exports a shared protocol entrypoint, and `@shopwise/ui-protocol` exports JSON schemas and TypeScript types.",
