    {
      "id": "claim_c8dba5248f0043ce88c93030661bd947",
      "statement": "The Go backend is a stateful service with mandatory infrastructure dependencies and operational defaults wired in config: it defaults to port `18080`, web app URL `http://localhost:3001`, and AI runtime URL `http://localhost:8000`, and refuses startup without database, Redis, and JWT secret configuration.",
